Drizzle schema lives in the db package. After editing it, run `{{pm}} db:generate` to write a SQL migration and `{{pm}} db:migrate` to apply it. Inspect data with `{{pm}} db:studio`.

`{{pm}} db:push` syncs the schema without a migration file. drizzle-kit asks for confirmation, so run it from a terminal; `{{pm}} db:push --force` skips the prompt for scripts.
